          "text": "$F=\\sin(xyz)$. $F_x=yz\\cos(xyz)$, $F_y=xz\\cos(xyz)$, $F_z=xy\\cos(xyz)$.\nВ $(\\pi,1,1)$: $\\cos(\\pi)=-1$.\n$F_x=-1$, $F_y=-\\pi$, $F_z=-\\pi$."
        },
        {
          "title": "Производные",
          "text": "$z_x'=-F_x/F_z=-(-1)/(-\\pi)=-1/\\pi$.\n$z_y'=-F_y/F_z=-(-\\pi)/(-\\pi)=-1$."
        },
